Subject: [PATCH 4/8] nouveau: add a start code to vc1 simple and main pictures

VP3 to VP5's BSP expects a start code in front of each VC-1 picture. The
VA frontend only adds one for Advanced profile, so Simple and Main
pictures decode to garbage, and VP can hang on a later picture.

Add the frame start code in front of Simple and Main pictures, and drop
the assert against Simple in nouveau_vp3_fill_picparm_vc1_vp, which made
debug builds abort on the first Simple picture.

